- The magnitude of $\mathbf{b}$ is $ \|\mathbf{b}\| = 8 $, so $\mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{b} = \|\mathbf{b}\|^2 = 64$.
- The angle between $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ is $135^\circ$, so the dot product $\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}$ is:
$$
\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} = \|\mathbf{a}\| \|\mathbf{b}\| \cos(135^\circ) = 3 \cdot 8 \cdot \cos(135^\circ)
