### Step 3: Compute the scalar triple product $ \vec{a} \cdot (\vec{v_1} \times \vec{v_2}) $

Given:
$$
\vec{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ 7 \\ 11 \end{pmatrix}, \quad \vec{v_1} \times \vec{v_2} = \begin{pmatrix} 7k - 28 \\ -14 \\ 12 - k \end{pmatrix}
$$

